  "description": "<p>Patching an ACL fails. I have a test object ACL that was.</p>\n\n<p><tt>@prefix webac: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/webac#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/webac#</a>&gt; .</tt><br/>\n<tt>@prefix acl: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#</a>&gt; .</tt><br/>\n<tt>@prefix rdf: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#</a>&gt; .</tt><br/>\n<tt>@prefix fedora: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#</a>&gt; .</tt><br/>\n<tt>@prefix ldp: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#</a>&gt; .</tt></p>\n\n<p><tt>&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl#authorization\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl#authorization</a>&gt;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type acl:Authorization ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  acl:agent \"testuser\" ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  acl:mode acl:Read ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  acl:mode acl:Write ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  acl:accessTo &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box</a>&gt; ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  acl:default &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box</a>&gt; .</tt></p>\n\n<p><tt>&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl</a>&gt;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  fedora:created \"2020-11-06T14:16:25.842650Z\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime</a>&gt; ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  fedora:lastModified \"2020-11-06T14:17:19.091992Z\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime</a>&gt; ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  fedora:createdBy \"fedoraAdmin\" ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  fedora:lastModifiedBy \"fedoraAdmin\" ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type webac:Acl ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type ldp:Resource ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type fedora:Resource ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type ldp:RDFSource ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type ldp:Container ;</tt><br/>\n<tt>  rdf:type fedora:Container .</tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>When I execute this request.</p>\n\n<p><tt>curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" -d \" DELETE { &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl#authorization\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl#authorization</a>&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#default\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#default</a>&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box</a>&gt; } WHERE { }\" <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:acl</a> -XPATCH</tt></p>\n\n<p><tt>I would expect the acl:default clause to be removed, but nothing changes even though I get the 204 response.</tt></p>\n\n<p><tt>I think this is because the identifier translator which is operating in the FedoraLdp PATCH section is not in the FedoraAcl PATCH section.</tt></p>",
